    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully Presented Top-Floor Two-Bedroom Apartment with Large Private Balcony\nApartment 37, Block A, The Harbour, Athy, Co. Kildare, is a beautifully presented two-bedroom top-floor apartment enjoying excellent views across the Athy skyline. Ideally positioned within easy walking distance of the town centre and a wide range of local amenities, this attractive apartment offers comfortable, modern living in a convenient location.\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious open-plan living room/dining area and kitchen, with patio doors opening directly onto a large private balcony an excellent additional outdoor space and an ideal spot to relax and enjoy the elevated views.\nThere are two well-proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from a private en suite, together with a separate family bathroom.\nThe apartment is serviced by an internal lift, while there is ample on-street parking available in the surrounding area.\nThe property is ideally located close to shops, schools, restaurants, cafes and all the amenities Athy has to offer. The recently opened Grand Canal Blueway is also nearby, providing an excellent amenity for walking, cycling and enjoying the riverside surroundings.\nPresented in excellent condition and ready for immediate occupation, this property would make an ideal first-time purchase, investment property or low-maintenance home.\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality, space and excellent location of this top-floor apartment.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 3.14m (10'4\") x 1.06m (3'6\")\nFront Door, Timber Floors, Airing Press\n\nKitchen - 3.39m (11'1\") x 2.33m (7'8\")\n\nLiving Room / Kitchen - 4.25m (13'11\") x 4.36m (14'4\")\nFully Fitted Wall & Floor Units Patio Door to Balcony. Timber Floors,\n\nUtility Room - 2.46m (8'1\") x 1.38m (4'6\")\nPlumbing for Washing Machine, Tiled Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 6.22m (20'5\") x 2.86m (9'5\")\nPatio Door to Balcony, Timber Floor, Radiator.\n\nEn-suite - 2.77m (9'1\") x 1.66m (5'5\")\nShower Cubicle with Mixer Shower, W.C. Wash Hand Basin, Part-Tiled Walls, Tiled Floors\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.01m (9'11\") x 4.66m (15'3\")\nTimber Floors, Radiator.\n\nBathroom - 2.06m (6'9\") x 1.66m (5'5\")\nBath with Mixer Taps & Shower Head, W.C. Wash Hand Basin, Part-Tiled Walls, Tiled Floor\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
